1u5p|n|of Sheet ; Cotton or linen cloth suitable for bed sheets. It is sometimes made of double width. ; A lining of planks or boards (rarely of metal) for protecting an embankment. ; The act or process of forming into sheets, or flat pieces; also, material made into sheets.	a:1jda,106,6~1jda,106,6	n:1jda,80,1~1jda,80,1
