1uba|n|One of the small pieces, or splinters, into which a brittle thing is broken by sudden violence; -- generally used in the plural. ; A thin slice; a shive. ; A variety of blue slate. ; A sheave or small wheel in a pulley. ; A small wedge, as for fastening the bolt of a window shutter. ; A spindle. ; The act of shivering or trembling.	a:1h5t,142,1~1h5t,142,1	n:1h5t,142,1~1h5t,142,1
